# Privacy defense in depth only; ignore rules are not encryption or an access-control boundary.
**/inbox/**
**/draft/**
**/out/**
**/.workspace/**

# Book translation projects stay private; add them in private mode only via the repository-mode wrapper.
/book-translations/*
!/book-translations/AGENTS.md

# Documents and ebook source material.
*.pdf
*.epub
*.mobi
*.azw
*.azw3
*.djvu

# LaTeX auxiliary and build logs.
*.aux
*.log
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex
*.synctex.gz
*.bbl
*.blg
*.toc
*.out
*.run.xml
